cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Fit of a von Mises mixture to a TCday sample"
abstract: "R code that fits a mixture of von Mises distributions to a sample of tropical cyclone days (TCday) and extracts the seasonality percentiles (TCnth) used in Treppiedi et al., Contrasting Shifts in Tropical Cyclone Seasonality Across Global Basins."
type: software
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dtreppiedi/tc-seasonality-vonmises"
keywords:
  - tropical cyclones
  - seasonality
  - circular statistics
  - von Mises distribution
